  "name": "Software Quality Observatory Orchestrator",
  "description": "A modular and containerized orchestrator for assessing research software quality. It uses n8n and RabbitMQ to coordinate incremental metadata extraction with SOCA and SOMEF, FAIR quality assessments with RSFC and RESQUI, metadata checks with sw-metadata-bot and RsMetaCheck, publication to DashVERSE, and generation of a software catalogue portal.",
